#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:24
msgid ""
"Automatically reboot the router during the configured dawn time window when "
"network traffic is idle."
msgstr ""
"네트워크 트래픽이 유휴 상태일 때 설정된 새벽 시간대 동안 라우터를 자동으로 재"
"부팅합니다."

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:48
msgid "Dawn window end (HH:MM)"
msgstr "새벽 윈도우 종료 시각 (HH:MM)"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:38
msgid "Dawn window start (HH:MM)"
msgstr "새벽 윈도우 시작 시각 (HH:MM)"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:70
msgid ""
"Duration in seconds to monitor traffic before making a reboot decision."
msgstr "재부팅을 결정하기 전에 네트워크 트래픽을 모니터링할 시간(초)입니다."

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:29
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "활성화"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-smart-reboot.json:3
msgid "Grant access to smart-reboot configuration"
msgstr "smart-reboot 설정에 접근 권한 부여"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:58
msgid "Idle threshold (KB)"
msgstr "유휴 판단 임계값 (KB)"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:32
msgid "Last automatic reboot"
msgstr "마지막 자동 재부팅"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:82
msgid "Leave unselected to automatically monitor active WAN interfaces."
msgstr "선택하지 않으면 활성 WAN 인터페이스를 자동으로 감지하여 모니터링합니다."

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:63
msgid ""
"Maximum total traffic in KB allowed during the sampling period to be "
"considered idle."
msgstr ""
"유휴 상태로 판단하기 위해 샘플링 기간 동안 허용되는 최대 총 트래픽(KB)입니다."

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:79
msgid "Monitored interfaces"
msgstr "모니터링 대상 인터페이스"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:35
msgid "Never"
msgstr "기록 없음"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:72
msgid "Retry interval (seconds)"
msgstr "재시도 대기 간격 (초)"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:65
msgid "Sampling duration (seconds)"
msgstr "샘플링 측정 시간 (초)"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:26
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "설정"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:23
#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-smart-reboot.json:3
msgid "Smart Reboot"
msgstr "스마트 재부팅"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:44
msgid "Time format must be HH:MM (24-hour). Example: 03:00"
msgstr "시간 형식은 24시간제 HH:MM이어야 합니다. 예: 03:00"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:54
msgid "Time format must be HH:MM (24-hour). Example: 06:00"
msgstr "시간 형식은 24시간제 HH:MM이어야 합니다. 예: 06:00"

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:77
msgid "Wait time before retrying if traffic is active within the dawn window."
msgstr "새벽 윈도우 내에서 트래픽이 활성 상태일 때 다음 검사까지 대기할 시간입니다."

#: applications/luci-app-smart-reboot/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/smart-reboot.js:83
msgid "[All] All network interfaces except loopback"
msgstr "[전체] 루프백을 제외한 모든 네트워크 인터페이스"
